
# Exercise demo videos. Deliberately never committed: this repo is public and
# GitHub Pages serves it to anyone, so anything in here would be published.
# Files here are copied into the iOS app bundle only, which is signed to one
# device and never distributed.
demos-local/*
!demos-local/README.txt

# The bundled copy of the videos. sync-web.sh writes these into the app bundle
# on every build; committing them would put them straight back on the public
# site, which is the one thing demos-local/ exists to prevent.
ios/BrunianLifts/www/demos/
